# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository.
# Overrides core.autocrlf on Windows contributors so LF is stored and
# checked out everywhere, matching the existing tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: git should not touch these even if it guesses wrong.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
